EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Welcome back,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}I was
just worrying that maybe you were
gone for good.
I'm so relieved to see you again{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
that I'm actually tearing up a little.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000E:}}Waaaaah!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Thanks for coming back!

