{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Cosa?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sei TU {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ecco perché mi sembrava
